balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full financial year and the published year to date figures upto the third quarter of the financial year.  n8. Figures for the corresonding periods in the previous  year`s/ periods` have been regrouped/ rearranged/reclassified wherever necessary to make them comparable with the figures for the current period.  n </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
